messages.reasoning_content:
Noise from missing built-in shader chunks because chunks not initialized. Null device probably requires shader chunk defaults set by app. Could avoid by not calling createPasses, instead inject fake pass object into effect._pass in tests. But then createPasses is untested.

Alternatively mock './passes/frame-pass-lens-flare.js' to a fake class. Then createPasses uses fake and no shader noise. But LensFlareShapes also uses shader chunk. Could mock LensFlareShapes too? Hmm.

